# Spelunking, the other order (CR 616.1): Bot1 puts Opulent Palace from its hand, is asked which of the two replacements
# of its entry applies first, and takes Spelunking's, "lands you control enter untapped": it leaves the land untapped, then
# the Palace's own "This land enters tapped" applies, and it enters tapped (the ruling: "you can choose to have the land
# enter tapped or untapped").

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Spelunking
Opulent Palace
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
