Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Spelunking.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Opulent Palace)
Bot1.Replace(lands you control enter untapped)
